  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nWhenever we reference the Web IDL `Promise<T>` type, we should link to https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-promise .\r\n\r\nAlmost all of these occur inside Web IDL blocks, but https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9897 introduced one instance of `<code data-x=\"\">Promise&lt;<var>T</var>></code>` inside a note.\r\n\r\nThe link should be around the word `Promise`, omitting the `<T>`.",
